exports[`frodo config export Cloud "frodo config export --all-separate --read-only --no-metadata --default --directory exportAllTestDir3 --use-string-arrays --no-decode --no-coords --no-extract": should export everything, including default scripts, into separate files in the directory exportAllTestDir3 with scripts, no decoding variables, no journey coordinates, separate mappings, and using string arrays: exportAllTestDir3/realm/root-alpha/script/Check-Username.script.json 1`] = `
